  "prefLabel": "Cul-H 204.11 Appearances and Representations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cul-H 204.11 Appearances and Representations. A party or the party’s representative shall file an appearance that includes the following information:\n\n(a) A brief identification of the matter;\n\n(b) A statement as to whether or not the representative is an attorney and, if so, whether the attorney is licensed to practice in New Hampshire; and\n\n(c) The party or representative’s daytime telephone number and address.\n\nSource. #10218, eff 10-30-12, EXPIRED: 7-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cul-h200.html"
